(4113078, 590410, 52713, '<td valign="top">nice title</td>', 'nice title', '2007-09-24 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113133, 589071, 37104, '<td valign="top">Not a great subject for a still life, and I don''t see what''s in motion. Maybe the plants growing?</td>', 'Not a great subject for a still life, and I don''t see what''s in motion. Maybe the plants growing?', '2007-09-24 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113137, 589378, 37104, '<td valign="top">Man that pinwheel looks out of place. But I suppose that''s the point isn''t it? Nice and sharp, motion looks nice, great lighting. just an odd still life is all.</td>', 'Man that pinwheel looks out of place. But I suppose that''s the point isn''t it? Nice and sharp, motion looks nice, great lighting. just an odd still life is all.', '2007-09-24 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113141, 590727, 37104, '<td valign="top">I think this would look nicer if the stream water wasn''t so concentrated; if it looked more like rain and less like a shower.</td>', 'I think this would look nicer if the stream water wasn''t so concentrated; if it looked more like rain and less like a shower.', '2007-09-24 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113145, 590784, 37104, '<td valign="top">Dull composition, and it''s hard to tell what the moving object is.</td>', 'Dull composition, and it''s hard to tell what the moving object is.', '2007-09-24 20:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113147, 590902, 37104, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I would have liked more than just the one flower. The backdround is also a little dull, which detracts from the picture''s interest.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I would have liked more than just the one flower. The backdround is also a little dull, which detracts from the picture''s interest.', '2007-09-24 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113152, 590742, 37104, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Perfect motion, great natural-looking lighting, nice colors, and composition. The glare on the collinder is a tinge distracting, but overall a great shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot. Perfect motion, great natural-looking lighting, nice colors, and composition. The glare on the collinder is a tinge distracting, but overall a great shot!', '2007-09-24 20:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113156, 590870, 37104, '<td valign="top">So interesting. I don''t like that the ball, which is the subject of the picture is so small. This idea might have worked out better with a different "setup" and composition.</td>', 'So interesting. I don''t like that the ball, which is the subject of the picture is so small. This idea might have worked out better with a different "setup" and composition.', '2007-09-24 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113161, 588424, 37104, '<td valign="top">Cool looking. I don''t really see the still life, unless that''s what the red stuff is? I''m confused by this, but it looks to be technically sound.</td>', 'Cool looking. I don''t really see the still life, unless that''s what the red stuff is? I''m confused by this, but it looks to be technically sound.', '2007-09-24 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113164, 590343, 37104, '<td valign="top">Motion isn''t clear at all. Composition is a bland. The eye doesn''t really have aywhere strong to look.</td>', 'Motion isn''t clear at all. Composition is a bland. The eye doesn''t really have aywhere strong to look.', '2007-09-24 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113166, 589608, 37104, '<td valign="top">Ok, I suppose the second hand works as a seperate element...The image is nice and sharp, the part that kills it for me is that annoying magnifier at the bottom. You can see the reflection in it, and it takes away from the sharness of the shot. I know it''s not really your fault, but it detracts from the picture.</td>', 'Ok, I suppose the second hand works as a seperate element...The image is nice and sharp, the part that kills it for me is that annoying magnifier at the bottom. You can see the reflection in it, and it takes away from the sharness of the shot. I know it''s not really your fault, but it detracts from the picture.', '2007-09-24 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113173, 590901, 37104, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.... I''m gonna have to go with DNMC on this one, as it can be considered all still life or all motion. There isn''t really any difference.</td>', 'Hmmmm.... I''m gonna have to go with DNMC on this one, as it can be considered all still life or all motion. There isn''t really any difference.', '2007-09-24 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113178, 589354, 37104, '<td valign="top">Terrific! The lighting is very nice and soft. The composition is pretty good, that corner in the background is pretty distracting. I also would have liked to see a little more motion with the bird.</td>', 'Terrific! The lighting is very nice and soft. The composition is pretty good, that corner in the background is pretty distracting. I also would have liked to see a little more motion with the bird.', '2007-09-24 20:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113182, 590724, 37104, '<td valign="top">The composition forces the motion to the side, which to me, just takes it out of the picture completely. The lighting makes some harsh highlights, primarily on the bowl in the top. Overall, it''s just kind of weak.</td>', 'The composition forces the motion to the side, which to me, just takes it out of the picture completely. The lighting makes some harsh highlights, primarily on the bowl in the top. Overall, it''s just kind of weak.', '2007-09-24 20:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113186, 590558, 37104, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The colors are pretty good, and the reflection is very nice. The motion of lighting the candle is particularly clear. The shot also looks a little grainy to me. Oh, and nice contrast.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The colors are pretty good, and the reflection is very nice. The motion of lighting the candle is particularly clear. The shot also looks a little grainy to me. Oh, and nice contrast.', '2007-09-24 20:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113188, 590873, 37104, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. The colors are great in this shot! The lighting is iffy for me; it creates some unflattering shadows...</td>', 'Nice effect. The colors are great in this shot! The lighting is iffy for me; it creates some unflattering shadows...', '2007-09-24 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113191, 590873, 37444, '<td valign="top">wonderfully colorful - 8</td>', 'wonderfully colorful - 8', '2007-09-24 20:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113192, 588402, 37444, '<td valign="top">nicely done - 8</td>', 'nicely done - 8', '2007-09-24 20:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113193, 590047, 37104, '<td valign="top">Composition is what hurts this image. The idea is cool and the lighting works pretty well. I just find myself looking around the moving car more than I do at the car itself.</td>', 'Composition is what hurts this image. The idea is cool and the lighting works pretty well. I just find myself looking around the moving car more than I do at the car itself.', '2007-09-24 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113194, 590826, 37444, '<td valign="top">nicely done - 8</td>', 'nicely done - 8', '2007-09-24 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113199, 590776, 37104, '<td valign="top">Really? I wouldn''t have guessed it was a bullet without the title, so it would have been better if that was clear. Sharpness is also a problem. Composition could have been better, and that table is very distracting. I would suggest a different crop, and a rotate to correct that slight tilt.</td>', 'Really? I wouldn''t have guessed it was a bullet without the title, so it would have been better if that was clear. Sharpness is also a problem. Composition could have been better, and that table is very distracting. I would suggest a different crop, and a rotate to correct that slight tilt.', '2007-09-24 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113200, 590485, 37104, '<td valign="top">Interesting. This just doesn''t grab me. The butterflies are so small they don''t seem like a strong element in the shot.</td>', 'Interesting. This just doesn''t grab me. The butterflies are so small they don''t seem like a strong element in the shot.', '2007-09-24 20:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113203, 590764, 37104, '<td valign="top">Dull subject and somposition. The background is lacking as well. The focus on the dog''s back seems on, and the lighting seems pretty ok. This just lacks in creativity and interest.</td>', 'Dull subject and somposition. The background is lacking as well. The focus on the dog''s back seems on, and the lighting seems pretty ok. This just lacks in creativity and interest.', '2007-09-24 20:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113204, 589353, 37104, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the motion, sorry, DNMC.</td>', 'I don''t see the motion, sorry, DNMC.', '2007-09-24 20:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113208, 590397, 37104, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The composition is a little boring, and the subject itself is even in motion (looking at the legs holding up the painting). The colors are dull, and the lighting could have been much better.</td>', 'Good idea. The composition is a little boring, and the subject itself is even in motion (looking at the legs holding up the painting). The colors are dull, and the lighting could have been much better.', '2007-09-24 20:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113209, 590661, 37104, '<td valign="top">Great technicals!! Love the lighting, the motion blur, the composition, the colors! I can''t decide whether or not the fold is distracting or interesting... The idea was interesting, although it doesn''t make much sense for a whisk to not be whisking...</td>', 'Great technicals!! Love the lighting, the motion blur, the composition, the colors! I can''t decide whether or not the fold is distracting or interesting... The idea was interesting, although it doesn''t make much sense for a whisk to not be whisking...', '2007-09-24 20:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113213, 590195, 37104, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting. The shot itself lacks dynamics. It''s not a very interesting setup and ends up just confusing. The colors, however, are bold and well brought-out.</td>', 'The background is very distracting. The shot itself lacks dynamics. It''s not a very interesting setup and ends up just confusing. The colors, however, are bold and well brought-out.', '2007-09-24 20:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113215, 590410, 37104, '<td valign="top">Awesome. A classic idea, but it fits in nicely with this challenge. My only complaints are the glare on the bottle, and the shadow. I think it would benefit from a closer crop, but I''m not sure how that would work with the moving light. Well done.</td>', 'Awesome. A classic idea, but it fits in nicely with this challenge. My only complaints are the glare on the bottle, and the shadow. I think it would benefit from a closer crop, but I''m not sure how that would work with the moving light. Well done.', '2007-09-24 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113217, 588487, 37104, '<td valign="top">Focus on the flower is off, and the water splashes aren''t very apparent. The lighting is distracting on the water, and not strong enough on the flower. The colors look a little washed out as well. The idea was nice.</td>', 'Focus on the flower is off, and the water splashes aren''t very apparent. The lighting is distracting on the water, and not strong enough on the flower. The colors look a little washed out as well. The idea was nice.', '2007-09-24 20:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
