(4113229, 590706, 37104, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. The composition of the still life isn''t very interesting. The motion is nice, however, and the green is a nice contrast to the browns.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. The composition of the still life isn''t very interesting. The motion is nice, however, and the green is a nice contrast to the browns.', '2007-09-24 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
