(4113262, 590651, 84597, '<td valign="top">Great strong contrasts here, the vignette ads the dramatic touch to the photo, well done :)</td>', 'Great strong contrasts here, the vignette ads the dramatic touch to the photo, well done :)', '2007-09-24 21:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113266, 590595, 67152, '<td valign="top">the details from the lighting and the smoke make for such an outstanding image</td>', 'the details from the lighting and the smoke make for such an outstanding image', '2007-09-24 21:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113280, 590653, 84597, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but a tip from me would be to leave the ground less detailed, and with fewer things to focus on. Since the leaf should be the main action and have the attention here :)</td>', 'Nice concept, but a tip from me would be to leave the ground less detailed, and with fewer things to focus on. Since the leaf should be the main action and have the attention here :)', '2007-09-24 21:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113317, 589920, 83817, '<td valign="top">Nice, bright colors. I like the blur of the water in the background which doesn''t take away from the focus of the primary object - a beautiful yellow, orange flower.</td>', 'Nice, bright colors. I like the blur of the water in the background which doesn''t take away from the focus of the primary object - a beautiful yellow, orange flower.', '2007-09-24 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113321, 590767, 83817, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect and good choice of color combinations..</td>', 'Very nice effect and good choice of color combinations..', '2007-09-24 21:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113325, 590724, 83817, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white as opposed to a color photo</td>', 'I like the black and white as opposed to a color photo', '2007-09-24 21:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113330, 590826, 83817, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. Nice layout and the splash is very noticeable even though the background is so dark.</td>', 'I like this very much. Nice layout and the splash is very noticeable even though the background is so dark.', '2007-09-24 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113332, 589071, 83817, '<td valign="top">nice coloring</td>', 'nice coloring', '2007-09-24 21:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113341, 590294, 83817, '<td valign="top">Very nice pumpkin colors and choices, even though I am not a big fan of so much orange or yellow. I am assuming the blur (motion) is a leaf but it was a bit hard for me to tell. It may have been more noticeable for me if the background were a tiny bit darker. Again, beautiful pumpkin choices!</td>', 'Very nice pumpkin colors and choices, even though I am not a big fan of so much orange or yellow. I am assuming the blur (motion) is a leaf but it was a bit hard for me to tell. It may have been more noticeable for me if the background were a tiny bit darker. Again, beautiful pumpkin choices!', '2007-09-24 22:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113344, 589392, 83817, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!</td>', 'Very nicely done!', '2007-09-24 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113345, 589745, 83817, '<td valign="top">Nice pepper color choice. I would have liked to have seen more movement with the water for a little stronger effect.</td>', 'Nice pepper color choice. I would have liked to have seen more movement with the water for a little stronger effect.', '2007-09-24 22:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113348, 589676, 83817, '<td valign="top">nice color choices, especially using red-gummed teeth with red flowers.</td>', 'nice color choices, especially using red-gummed teeth with red flowers.', '2007-09-24 22:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113350, 590742, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice effects and beautiful coloring with the vegetables. Nice contrasts</td>', 'very nice effects and beautiful coloring with the vegetables. Nice contrasts', '2007-09-24 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113354, 590723, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice picture although I don''t see the motion - the hand could have just been posed...it does not show motion as Still Life With Motion suggests. However, I do love the color and effect. Strawberries in a colored bowl with a black background is very striking, and the hand has a very nice shape to it.</td>', 'very nice picture although I don''t see the motion - the hand could have just been posed...it does not show motion as Still Life With Motion suggests. However, I do love the color and effect. Strawberries in a colored bowl with a black background is very striking, and the hand has a very nice shape to it.', '2007-09-24 22:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113358, 588487, 83817, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The red background is beautifully contrasted with the white daisies. The water splashes are great,especially with some of the drops landing on the daisy.</td>', 'I like this very much. The red background is beautifully contrasted with the white daisies. The water splashes are great,especially with some of the drops landing on the daisy.', '2007-09-24 22:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113359, 590873, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice and colorful. flowers are centered nicely.</td>', 'very nice and colorful. flowers are centered nicely.', '2007-09-24 22:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113363, 590727, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nicely done. nice choice of colors.</td>', 'very nicely done. nice choice of colors.', '2007-09-24 22:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113368, 590898, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2007-09-24 22:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113373, 590590, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice touch having the cork move. Looks like the curtains are moving a bit as well...very nice.</td>', 'very nice touch having the cork move. Looks like the curtains are moving a bit as well...very nice.', '2007-09-24 22:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113375, 590470, 83817, '<td valign="top">very nice colors!</td>', 'very nice colors!', '2007-09-24 22:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
