(4113383, 590888, 83817, '<td valign="top">Ashamed you had to break the wine glass. : )   But very nice effects and I love the shading and coloring of the grapes and background. Very nice!</td>', 'Ashamed you had to break the wine glass. : )   But very nice effects and I love the shading and coloring of the grapes and background. Very nice!', '2007-09-24 22:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
