(4113420, 590837, 3102, '<td valign="top">A clever enough concept, but I''m not sure it was carried out as well as it could have been.  The rock/paper aren''t in sharp focus -- it looks like the camera was bumped while doing the scissors stuff.  And a more solid background, or more appealing background would have been helpful.</td>', 'A clever enough concept, but I''m not sure it was carried out as well as it could have been.  The rock/paper aren''t in sharp focus -- it looks like the camera was bumped while doing the scissors stuff.  And a more solid background, or more appealing background would have been helpful.', '2007-09-24 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
