(4113645, 590651, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo. The tones are excellent. As far as meeting this challenge well I can''t say you did here. For me, still life is more than just shooting inanimate object. It''s about creating a scene and not capturing a preexisting one. Just my opinion of course.</td>', 'Very pretty photo. The tones are excellent. As far as meeting this challenge well I can''t say you did here. For me, still life is more than just shooting inanimate object. It''s about creating a scene and not capturing a preexisting one. Just my opinion of course.', '2007-09-25 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
