(4113697, 590717, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think the concept would work if the lighting was better. Btw, I bet you''re pulling the hammer away from the eggs to avoid that mess. :P</td>', 'I think the concept would work if the lighting was better. Btw, I bet you''re pulling the hammer away from the eggs to avoid that mess. :P', '2007-09-25 00:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
