(4113995, 590732, 82817, '<td valign="top">I''m hungry even in B&amp;W. The movement and the limited DOF really work well. I don''t know what the white object is in the left third of the photo but it seems to call attention to itself.</td>', 'I''m hungry even in B&W. The movement and the limited DOF really work well. I don''t know what the white object is in the left third of the photo but it seems to call attention to itself.', '2007-09-25 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4113998, 589750, 82817, '<td valign="top">Nice slow shutter speed. There are a couple of spots on the coffee dispenser that could have been cloned out. I like the moodiness of the shadows.</td>', 'Nice slow shutter speed. There are a couple of spots on the coffee dispenser that could have been cloned out. I like the moodiness of the shadows.', '2007-09-25 04:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114002, 589937, 82817, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to look at and I am not clear about what to focus on. The pendulum or the globe with the upside down still life or the picture. Somehow I think I would have like the painting as the background without the white around it.</td>', 'There is a lot to look at and I am not clear about what to focus on. The pendulum or the globe with the upside down still life or the picture. Somehow I think I would have like the painting as the background without the white around it.', '2007-09-25 04:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114003, 589884, 82817, '<td valign="top">The water seems a bit too soft for the movement IMO. I am amazed at the emotional pull between the fall setting and the flowers. Almost like not wanting to let go of summer.</td>', 'The water seems a bit too soft for the movement IMO. I am amazed at the emotional pull between the fall setting and the flowers. Almost like not wanting to let go of summer.', '2007-09-25 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
