(4114005, 589608, 82817, '<td valign="top">I miss the rest of the watch but I understand the compositional aspect of the photo. Love the movement especially the orange. Well done.</td>', 'I miss the rest of the watch but I understand the compositional aspect of the photo. Love the movement especially the orange. Well done.', '2007-09-25 04:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114006, 590097, 82817, '<td valign="top">I hope you got two of every fruit with the way the water is rising. Love the idea but the top of the water looks unreal next to the forest.</td>', 'I hope you got two of every fruit with the way the water is rising. Love the idea but the top of the water looks unreal next to the forest.', '2007-09-25 04:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114007, 589190, 82817, '<td valign="top">I kept looking and thinking, where''s the movement? Then I noticed the person in the left background. The angle of the arch seems a bit odd to my eyes. I would have loved richer blue in the sky. The orange colors are wonderful.</td>', 'I kept looking and thinking, where''s the movement? Then I noticed the person in the left background. The angle of the arch seems a bit odd to my eyes. I would have loved richer blue in the sky. The orange colors are wonderful.', '2007-09-25 04:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114025, 590470, 49109, '<td valign="top">looks like the wine is pouring through the glass - strange... crop at left is a bit tight. good setup (except for the glass, which is for brandy not for wine), very good lighting and processing, though the grapes are a bit soft. I''d guess this is Marac''s work?</td>', 'looks like the wine is pouring through the glass - strange... crop at left is a bit tight. good setup (except for the glass, which is for brandy not for wine), very good lighting and processing, though the grapes are a bit soft. I''d guess this is Marac''s work?', '2007-09-25 06:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114026, 589354, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice still life, though the angles in the background are distracting. The bird is a bit too blurred; IMO the motion blur wasn''t necessary to convey the motion.</td>', 'nice still life, though the angles in the background are distracting. The bird is a bit too blurred; IMO the motion blur wasn''t necessary to convey the motion.', '2007-09-25 06:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114028, 590723, 49109, '<td valign="top">very well done, clever idea - motion without blur. excellent sharpness, very good lighting - love the contrast of red strawberries vs. the black background. The silver ring and long nails add a nice bourgeois touch. small nitpick would be the slightly brighter background behind the berries next to the bowl. Would also have been nicer, if one or two of the strawberries in the bowl still had their petals.</td>', 'very well done, clever idea - motion without blur. excellent sharpness, very good lighting - love the contrast of red strawberries vs. the black background. The silver ring and long nails add a nice bourgeois touch. small nitpick would be the slightly brighter background behind the berries next to the bowl. Would also have been nicer, if one or two of the strawberries in the bowl still had their petals.', '2007-09-25 06:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114029, 589578, 49109, '<td valign="top">great work - is the cat in the back real? good setup and focus. the blue triangles seem misplaced and  are slightly distracting</td>', 'great work - is the cat in the back real? good setup and focus. the blue triangles seem misplaced and  are slightly distracting', '2007-09-25 06:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4114030, 589764, 49109, '<td valign="top">that''s nice. great idea to stick some flowers to the wall to simulate them being flipped through the air by the scissors. had preferred a POV slightly more to the right, so the vase was more at left and the hand fully included.</td>', 'that''s nice. great idea to stick some flowers to the wall to simulate them being flipped through the air by the scissors. had preferred a POV slightly more to the right, so the vase was more at left and the hand fully included.', '2007-09-25 06:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
