(4115026, 590885, 66952, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely. Nice colors, composition, and very nice subtle lighting. I''m not sure the moving curtain really adds anything to the composition, other than making the image meet the challenge. But the main part of the image is great.</td>', 'This is really lovely. Nice colors, composition, and very nice subtle lighting. I''m not sure the moving curtain really adds anything to the composition, other than making the image meet the challenge. But the main part of the image is great.', '2007-09-25 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
