(4115444, 589378, 77196, '<td valign="top">While this is a clever idea, the pinwheel is very out of context with the rest of the picture. I find it a bit of a ;-p Excellent lighting and detail - love the grapes.</td>', 'While this is a clever idea, the pinwheel is very out of context with the rest of the picture. I find it a bit of a ;-p Excellent lighting and detail - love the grapes.', '2007-09-25 21:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
