(4116488, 590862, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Took me a second to see the bullet. I''m curious to know how you setup the spray shooting out of the apple.</td>', 'Cool shot. Took me a second to see the bullet. I''m curious to know how you setup the spray shooting out of the apple.', '2007-09-26 04:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
