(4117360, 589463, 84323, '<td valign="top">Nice idea... very unusual setting for a still life, right on the money for the challenge. I think it may be helpful to have either another foreground element (rock, moss, etc...) and put the bowl and fruit in the midground (maybe even in the water so it rushes around it), or shoot with a wider angle and use the bowl as more in-your-face foreground element. Great idea as it was anyway. Sorry, can''t vote!</td>', 'Nice idea... very unusual setting for a still life, right on the money for the challenge. I think it may be helpful to have either another foreground element (rock, moss, etc...) and put the bowl and fruit in the midground (maybe even in the water so it rushes around it), or shoot with a wider angle and use the bowl as more in-your-face foreground element. Great idea as it was anyway. Sorry, can''t vote!', '2007-09-26 12:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
