(4118252, 588487, 65763, '<td valign="top">I like but in my opinion, if it were taken from a wee bit more of a side view, the splash of the drop would look much more nifty.</td>', 'I like but in my opinion, if it were taken from a wee bit more of a side view, the splash of the drop would look much more nifty.', '2007-09-26 18:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118255, 589970, 57229, '<td valign="top">Like the square shapes. Good choice with the monochrome.</td>', 'Like the square shapes. Good choice with the monochrome.', '2007-09-26 18:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118256, 590723, 65763, '<td valign="top">The nails.<br/> <br/>They scare me.</td>', 'The nails. They scare me.', '2007-09-26 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118264, 589774, 57229, '<td valign="top">Clever as anything set up. I think the lighting and/or the multiple exposure has taken the texture out of the food items. That''s a bit of a no no in my still life book, sorry.</td>', 'Clever as anything set up. I think the lighting and/or the multiple exposure has taken the texture out of the food items. That''s a bit of a no no in my still life book, sorry.', '2007-09-26 18:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118267, 590590, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautifully composed still life and scene. I wish the cork didn''t sort of disappear down in the corner there...</td>', 'It''s a beautifully composed still life and scene. I wish the cork didn''t sort of disappear down in the corner there...', '2007-09-26 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118270, 589392, 57229, '<td valign="top">Great idea. No doubt it would have taken a lot to make this work while including the rim of the glass, but it does look a bit truncated without it.</td>', 'Great idea. No doubt it would have taken a lot to make this work while including the rim of the glass, but it does look a bit truncated without it.', '2007-09-26 18:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118285, 590888, 66524, '<td valign="top">My fav in this challenge...it''s an excellent idea and the title really fits.  FWIW...I find the wine bottle distracting and I like my <i>imagined</i> view with it out of there ;)  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'My fav in this challenge...it''s an excellent idea and the title really fits.  FWIW...I find the wine bottle distracting and I like my imagined view with it out of there ;)  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-09-26 18:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118292, 590722, 61222, '<td valign="top">Best so far!! Great image :-)</td>', 'Best so far!! Great image :-)', '2007-09-26 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118298, 589886, 65779, '<td valign="top">Interesting but not a still life.</td>', 'Interesting but not a still life.', '2007-09-26 18:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118301, 590757, 65779, '<td valign="top">OK but where''s the motion?</td>', 'OK but where''s the motion?', '2007-09-26 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118303, 589190, 65779, '<td valign="top">Nice but not a still life</td>', 'Nice but not a still life', '2007-09-26 18:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118304, 590222, 66524, '<td valign="top">I am really interested in the use of yellow!  It facinates me and something I will explore.  Thanks for the peek into your use of color.  Nice entry too :)</td>', 'I am really interested in the use of yellow!  It facinates me and something I will explore.  Thanks for the peek into your use of color.  Nice entry too :)', '2007-09-26 18:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118305, 590898, 65779, '<td valign="top">Also not a still life</td>', 'Also not a still life', '2007-09-26 18:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118307, 590264, 66524, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Smack, dead on clever for the challenge!</td>', 'I love this!  Smack, dead on clever for the challenge!', '2007-09-26 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118308, 589330, 65779, '<td valign="top">Pretty but not a still life</td>', 'Pretty but not a still life', '2007-09-26 18:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118314, 590725, 65779, '<td valign="top">This is simply not a still life</td>', 'This is simply not a still life', '2007-09-26 18:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118315, 590727, 66524, '<td valign="top">Love your idea!</td>', 'Love your idea!', '2007-09-26 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118318, 590732, 65779, '<td valign="top">Good idea but rather poor execution</td>', 'Good idea but rather poor execution', '2007-09-26 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118319, 590900, 65779, '<td valign="top">I like the feel and originality of this</td>', 'I like the feel and originality of this', '2007-09-26 18:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118320, 589750, 65779, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the machine are quite distracting but great otherwise</td>', 'The shadows on the machine are quite distracting but great otherwise', '2007-09-26 18:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118331, 590277, 66524, '<td valign="top">Very simple, Very cool...very 10! So clean &amp; concise</td>', 'Very simple, Very cool...very 10! So clean & concise', '2007-09-26 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118389, 589190, 58728, '<td valign="top">HA!  It took me about 10 seconds to find him!  Nice idea!  Lovely shot.</td>', 'HA!  It took me about 10 seconds to find him!  Nice idea!  Lovely shot.', '2007-09-26 19:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118479, 590910, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good shot. While the whites lack a little detail, overall the lighting is good. I like the idea of the exploding cork. Had that been a little more explosive looking I think that would have bumped the wow factor some more. Not sure how you would do that though except maybe running a hose behind it or throught the inside of the bottle.</td>', 'Good shot. While the whites lack a little detail, overall the lighting is good. I like the idea of the exploding cork. Had that been a little more explosive looking I think that would have bumped the wow factor some more. Not sure how you would do that though except maybe running a hose behind it or throught the inside of the bottle.', '2007-09-26 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118484, 590902, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good shot and idea. If you added some dust or fake a cobweb you could have sold the idea even more.</td>', 'Good shot and idea. If you added some dust or fake a cobweb you could have sold the idea even more.', '2007-09-26 20:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118488, 590248, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and it''s well shot. The composition is a little busy but otherwise pretty good.</td>', 'I like the idea and it''s well shot. The composition is a little busy but otherwise pretty good.', '2007-09-26 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118489, 590604, 41337, '<td valign="top">I wish the lighting was better but otherwise I like it. I particularly like the contrast between the flowers and the water fountain which kind of looks like a flower in of itself.</td>', 'I wish the lighting was better but otherwise I like it. I particularly like the contrast between the flowers and the water fountain which kind of looks like a flower in of itself.', '2007-09-26 20:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118490, 590590, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very easy on the eyes.</td>', 'Very easy on the eyes.', '2007-09-26 20:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118493, 590884, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Should do well.</td>', 'Nice shot. Should do well.', '2007-09-26 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118494, 590888, 41337, '<td valign="top">Ha. Good shot.</td>', 'Ha. Good shot.', '2007-09-26 20:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118495, 590742, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The motion also has some purpose. Good luck.</td>', 'Good composition. The motion also has some purpose. Good luck.', '2007-09-26 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118496, 590725, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what I normally would consider still life, however this shot does make you think it is. It is not until that motion blur vibrates through this image does the mind envision the silent stillness that existed only moments earlier.</td>', 'Not exactly what I normally would consider still life, however this shot does make you think it is. It is not until that motion blur vibrates through this image does the mind envision the silent stillness that existed only moments earlier.', '2007-09-26 20:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118503, 589354, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. I have to ask is that a real bird? It looks real but the motion blur seems weird to me.</td>', 'Good lighting. I have to ask is that a real bird? It looks real but the motion blur seems weird to me.', '2007-09-26 20:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118505, 590097, 81664, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like a crazy painting around the fruit. Very cool.</td>', 'Wow, looks like a crazy painting around the fruit. Very cool.', '2007-09-26 20:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118507, 590888, 81664, '<td valign="top">OOps. Love the idea! Great execution too!</td>', 'OOps. Love the idea! Great execution too!', '2007-09-26 20:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118508, 590826, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot. I don''t care too much for the floating look though.</td>', 'Good clean shot. I don''t care too much for the floating look though.', '2007-09-26 20:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118509, 590047, 81664, '<td valign="top">Looks like an explosion! Love it!</td>', 'Looks like an explosion! Love it!', '2007-09-26 20:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118511, 590870, 81664, '<td valign="top">Where is the "still life"?? Oh okay, I see it, the ball. hmm, interesting.</td>', 'Where is the "still life"?? Oh okay, I see it, the ball. hmm, interesting.', '2007-09-26 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118512, 589190, 81664, '<td valign="top">Lots of still going on, not much motion, except for that little tiny person. beautiful shot though. Great color!</td>', 'Lots of still going on, not much motion, except for that little tiny person. beautiful shot though. Great color!', '2007-09-26 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118515, 588424, 81664, '<td valign="top">Okay, I see the kiss...but where is the still life?<br/>I adore this photo, it is awesome, but it''s all motion and no still.</td>', 'Okay, I see the kiss...but where is the still life?I adore this photo, it is awesome, but it''s all motion and no still.', '2007-09-26 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118520, 590904, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I just wish there was more happening in the background. It appears nobody is dancing. I do like blur it creates, it''s almost like brush strokes.</td>', 'I like the idea. I just wish there was more happening in the background. It appears nobody is dancing. I do like blur it creates, it''s almost like brush strokes.', '2007-09-26 20:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118524, 590807, 41337, '<td valign="top">This could be better if the lighting was more dramatic.</td>', 'This could be better if the lighting was more dramatic.', '2007-09-26 20:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118530, 590805, 81664, '<td valign="top">oh that is cool. Looks like crushed candy is flowing into the cup. You executed this very well.</td>', 'oh that is cool. Looks like crushed candy is flowing into the cup. You executed this very well.', '2007-09-26 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118533, 590341, 81664, '<td valign="top">Wow, what the heck? How did you do that! Dying to know!</td>', 'Wow, what the heck? How did you do that! Dying to know!', '2007-09-26 20:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118534, 590379, 81664, '<td valign="top">Where is the still life? Looks like it''s all in motion.<br/> <br/>It is a beautiful shot none the less.</td>', 'Where is the still life? Looks like it''s all in motion. It is a beautiful shot none the less.', '2007-09-26 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118537, 590248, 81664, '<td valign="top">Oh perfectly done!!!! Love love love it!!!! 10</td>', 'Oh perfectly done!!!! Love love love it!!!! 10', '2007-09-26 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118544, 590222, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m having a little trouble finding the point of the motion besides just having it there to meet the challenge. If I''m missing the point feel free to let me know. Good shot otherwise.</td>', 'I''m having a little trouble finding the point of the motion besides just having it there to meet the challenge. If I''m missing the point feel free to let me know. Good shot otherwise.', '2007-09-26 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118552, 590582, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2007-09-26 20:41:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4118559, 590470, 81664, '<td valign="top">What a tremendous photo. I love the soft look of the grapes, I love that the glass is about to fall! I just love this photo! 10</td>', 'What a tremendous photo. I love the soft look of the grapes, I love that the glass is about to fall! I just love this photo! 10', '2007-09-26 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118593, 589676, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement and the mood you created but the toy kind of ruins it a little for me. I understand why it''s there but if it could have somehow been used in a way that didn''t say this is a toy it would have worked better if that makes sense. Perhaps a color shift would have broken that toy perception? Just a thought.</td>', 'I like the arrangement and the mood you created but the toy kind of ruins it a little for me. I understand why it''s there but if it could have somehow been used in a way that didn''t say this is a toy it would have worked better if that makes sense. Perhaps a color shift would have broken that toy perception? Just a thought.', '2007-09-26 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118610, 590870, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great panning!</td>', 'Great panning!', '2007-09-26 20:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118623, 590653, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I think a little turbulence added to the fall of the leaf would have made it a little more believable. As is the straight line drop makes it look a little fake.</td>', 'Great idea. I think a little turbulence added to the fall of the leaf would have made it a little more believable. As is the straight line drop makes it look a little fake.', '2007-09-26 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118678, 589884, 41337, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about this shot. On the one hand the lower half of the shot is artistic and brings all the elements together into a harmony, which to me meets the challenge beautifully. On the other hand, the top makes it look like a shoehorn attempt to get a waterfall shot included in a still life challenge. Can I fav half of the photo? :) <br/> <br/>Just my opnion of course so just take it as that. Good luck.</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about this shot. On the one hand the lower half of the shot is artistic and brings all the elements together into a harmony, which to me meets the challenge beautifully. On the other hand, the top makes it look like a shoehorn attempt to get a waterfall shot included in a still life challenge. Can I fav half of the photo? :)  Just my opnion of course so just take it as that. Good luck.', '2007-09-26 21:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118680, 590097, 41337, '<td valign="top">The flowing water enhances the still life. Just not sure about that huge tree in the background.</td>', 'The flowing water enhances the still life. Just not sure about that huge tree in the background.', '2007-09-26 21:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118688, 590573, 41337, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.</td>', 'Clever idea.', '2007-09-26 21:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118716, 590341, 16106, '<td valign="top">amazing shot. beautifully realised shot, i hope you explain how you did this in the notes. Sadly it is a better shot than a challenge entry, as others have delt better with the challenge.</td>', 'amazing shot. beautifully realised shot, i hope you explain how you did this in the notes. Sadly it is a better shot than a challenge entry, as others have delt better with the challenge.', '2007-09-26 21:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118786, 589353, 41337, '<td valign="top">I find it interesting that there are no straight lines in this photo. If I were to re-title it based on my interpretion, I''d call it "joyfully subdued". The curves give it an energy and the colors tempers it somewhat. I like it as is but I think a bolder color combination would have given you a higher score with the rest of the voters.</td>', 'I find it interesting that there are no straight lines in this photo. If I were to re-title it based on my interpretion, I''d call it "joyfully subdued". The curves give it an energy and the colors tempers it somewhat. I like it as is but I think a bolder color combination would have given you a higher score with the rest of the voters.', '2007-09-26 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118788, 590805, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not a whole lot of meaning but well executed.</td>', 'Not a whole lot of meaning but well executed.', '2007-09-26 22:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118795, 590873, 41337, '<td valign="top">That yellow streak crossover grabs too much attention but otherwise the streaks add to the shot.</td>', 'That yellow streak crossover grabs too much attention but otherwise the streaks add to the shot.', '2007-09-26 22:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118812, 590885, 41337, '<td valign="top">If there ever was a still life filled with life and (e)motion this is it. I like how the curtain''s motion doesn''t overpower the subject but rather adds to it like a chapter in a story.</td>', 'If there ever was a still life filled with life and (e)motion this is it. I like how the curtain''s motion doesn''t overpower the subject but rather adds to it like a chapter in a story.', '2007-09-26 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118824, 590732, 41337, '<td valign="top">The composition adds some interest and the tones are good. While it meets the challenge it doesn''t feel like a still life to me. It''s more of a candid capture or a staged one.</td>', 'The composition adds some interest and the tones are good. While it meets the challenge it doesn''t feel like a still life to me. It''s more of a candid capture or a staged one.', '2007-09-26 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118828, 589542, 41337, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good enough to illuminate the subject but not good enough to make them sing and dance in an artistic sort of way, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'The lighting is good enough to illuminate the subject but not good enough to make them sing and dance in an artistic sort of way, if you know what I mean.', '2007-09-26 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118835, 589970, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tones.</td>', 'Fantastic tones.', '2007-09-26 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118836, 590717, 16106, '<td valign="top">good shot hurt slightly by the framing: There is alot of wasted black space up top and the bottom is squeezed so we dont get to see the whole of the egg, let alone a bit of empty space to balance out all the real estate up top.</td>', 'good shot hurt slightly by the framing: There is alot of wasted black space up top and the bottom is squeezed so we dont get to see the whole of the egg, let alone a bit of empty space to balance out all the real estate up top.', '2007-09-26 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118838, 590721, 41337, '<td valign="top">The oddity of this shot is it''s charm.</td>', 'The oddity of this shot is it''s charm.', '2007-09-26 22:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118845, 590277, 41337, '<td valign="top">It technically fits the challenge and is shot well but it comes across as more of a product shot than anything else.</td>', 'It technically fits the challenge and is shot well but it comes across as more of a product shot than anything else.', '2007-09-26 22:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118846, 589578, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice bright colors, but the yellows are too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'nice bright colors, but the yellows are too saturated for my taste.', '2007-09-26 22:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118849, 589764, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Could use a little more mood/passion in it''s presentation to sell the emotion that the title implies.</td>', 'Good shot. Could use a little more mood/passion in it''s presentation to sell the emotion that the title implies.', '2007-09-26 22:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118862, 589578, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very cute. The color adds a lot of punch.</td>', 'Very cute. The color adds a lot of punch.', '2007-09-26 22:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118865, 590485, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute. Not a fan of the blank background but it works here.</td>', 'Cute. Not a fan of the blank background but it works here.', '2007-09-26 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118867, 590835, 41337, '<td valign="top">There appears to be a color cast but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'There appears to be a color cast but otherwise a nice shot.', '2007-09-26 22:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118914, 589413, 27481, '<td valign="top">nice touch definetly fits the challenge</td>', 'nice touch definetly fits the challenge', '2007-09-26 23:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118923, 590195, 66524, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, but I wish the background color wasn''t split.  Blue would have worked for me given the orange in the Hummels...FWIW  :)</td>', 'I like this one a lot, but I wish the background color wasn''t split.  Blue would have worked for me given the orange in the Hummels...FWIW  :)', '2007-09-26 23:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4118930, 589378, 66524, '<td valign="top">I love the black area in this - I think my entry could have used this, but I don''t know how...anyway I voted 7</td>', 'I love the black area in this - I think my entry could have used this, but I don''t know how...anyway I voted 7', '2007-09-26 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119060, 590908, 41337, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good. I like that the motion blur has purpose and wasn''t just added with no relevancy to the subject. What this lacks though is it''s a little on the boring side. It doesn''t capture my attention and hold it.<br/> <br/>Edited for spelling.</td>', 'The lighting is good. I like that the motion blur has purpose and wasn''t just added with no relevancy to the subject. What this lacks though is it''s a little on the boring side. It doesn''t capture my attention and hold it. Edited for spelling.', '2007-09-27 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119085, 590862, 46832, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Good work.</td>', 'Wow!  Good work.', '2007-09-27 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119107, 590757, 84684, '<td valign="top">Love the bold colors in it, very beautiful.</td>', 'Love the bold colors in it, very beautiful.', '2007-09-27 00:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119126, 590248, 66524, '<td valign="top">this is stunning for the challenge!</td>', 'this is stunning for the challenge!', '2007-09-27 00:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119135, 590717, 66524, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge!</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge!', '2007-09-27 00:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
