(4121117, 590884, 80058, '<td valign="top">Stunning ;)</td>', 'Stunning ;)', '2007-09-27 20:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121120, 590885, 80058, '<td valign="top">Oh this is cool, with great potential... I think that if you had pplace the table in front of or closer to the window so that was part of the composition would''ve been stunning... I can''t vote but good luck =)</td>', 'Oh this is cool, with great potential... I think that if you had pplace the table in front of or closer to the window so that was part of the composition would''ve been stunning... I can''t vote but good luck =)', '2007-09-27 20:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121197, 590113, 84124, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous!  I''m impressed with the lack of noise as well as the length of the exposure without hitting sky fog or burnout.  well done!</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous!  I''m impressed with the lack of noise as well as the length of the exposure without hitting sky fog or burnout.  well done!', '2007-09-27 21:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121215, 590837, 76217, '<td valign="top">Certainly the most clever entry in the challenge but photo itself is just OK.</td>', 'Certainly the most clever entry in the challenge but photo itself is just OK.', '2007-09-27 22:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121221, 590097, 76217, '<td valign="top">There were quite a few variations of fruit and moving water in the challenge. Yours is best.</td>', 'There were quite a few variations of fruit and moving water in the challenge. Yours is best.', '2007-09-27 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121233, 589676, 76217, '<td valign="top">Nice still life on its own. The chattering teeth seem like an after-thought thrown in to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice still life on its own. The chattering teeth seem like an after-thought thrown in to meet the challenge.', '2007-09-27 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121250, 589071, 76217, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that is water in the background? If so, it doesn''t really "contrast" the still life as much as complement it. If not, I have no idea where the motion is.</td>', 'I''m guessing that is water in the background? If so, it doesn''t really "contrast" the still life as much as complement it. If not, I have no idea where the motion is.', '2007-09-27 22:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121256, 590902, 76217, '<td valign="top">Good idea, however, the basic premise is to <i>start</i> with an interesting still life. I don''t think you''ve done so.</td>', 'Good idea, however, the basic premise is to start with an interesting still life. I don''t think you''ve done so.', '2007-09-27 22:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121267, 589774, 76217, '<td valign="top">For me there is just way to much "stuff" going on here. You''ve got all the elements, but it looks like you just threw everthing into the air and took a picture. While I''m sure it took much effort, the end result appears chaotic.</td>', 'For me there is just way to much "stuff" going on here. You''ve got all the elements, but it looks like you just threw everthing into the air and took a picture. While I''m sure it took much effort, the end result appears chaotic.', '2007-09-27 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121315, 589578, 76217, '<td valign="top">Nice still life but I don''t think you''ve captured the motion part of the challenge very well. 6</td>', 'Nice still life but I don''t think you''ve captured the motion part of the challenge very well. 6', '2007-09-27 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121318, 590901, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is not my idea of a still life.</td>', 'This is not my idea of a still life.', '2007-09-27 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121324, 589378, 66384, '<td valign="top">The still life is beautiful. The pinwheel is glaringly out of place IMO.</td>', 'The still life is beautiful. The pinwheel is glaringly out of place IMO.', '2007-09-27 23:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121339, 588154, 76217, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life. I don''t see the motion. I think I know what you were going for but that would be perceived, and not actual motion. This will be a great test of the concept of the relevance of DNMC votes. If this were free study I''d give it an 8 or 9. Since the intent is there and it''s not a shoehorn or outright attempt not to meet the challenge, I will still give it a passing score of 5. Sorry.<br/> <br/>If it turns out this ribbons and everyone reading my comments afterwards thinks I''m a close minded idiot for not seeing how perfectly well this shot fit the challenge, I''m holding you personally responsible :)</td>', 'Beautiful still life. I don''t see the motion. I think I know what you were going for but that would be perceived, and not actual motion. This will be a great test of the concept of the relevance of DNMC votes. If this were free study I''d give it an 8 or 9. Since the intent is there and it''s not a shoehorn or outright attempt not to meet the challenge, I will still give it a passing score of 5. Sorry. If it turns out this ribbons and everyone reading my comments afterwards thinks I''m a close minded idiot for not seeing how perfectly well this shot fit the challenge, I''m holding you personally responsible :)', '2007-09-27 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121351, 590886, 76217, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture but I''m not sure what''s moving? Is it the blue ball? The curtain? How would I know?</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture but I''m not sure what''s moving? Is it the blue ball? The curtain? How would I know?', '2007-09-27 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121566, 590470, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like the deep colors. looks tasty.</td>', 'Like the deep colors. looks tasty.', '2007-09-28 01:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121573, 589071, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and texture, but where''s the motion?</td>', 'Nice colors and texture, but where''s the motion?', '2007-09-28 01:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121575, 590784, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice detail showing. Strong colors, but not overdone.</td>', 'Nice detail showing. Strong colors, but not overdone.', '2007-09-28 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121579, 590222, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m drowning in yellow!!! (But that''s a good thing.)</td>', 'I''m drowning in yellow!!! (But that''s a good thing.)', '2007-09-28 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121581, 590595, 83313, '<td valign="top">Understated and pleasing.</td>', 'Understated and pleasing.', '2007-09-28 01:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121884, 589745, 77192, '<td valign="top">You''ve controlled the exposure of the peppers well, except the red one, it looks a bit grainy and noisy to me but it might be my monitor. Can''t deny it fits the challenge but I''ve no idea why you photographed this lol - maybe you''re a creature of impulse who does things because you feel like it. Well done anyway</td>', 'You''ve controlled the exposure of the peppers well, except the red one, it looks a bit grainy and noisy to me but it might be my monitor. Can''t deny it fits the challenge but I''ve no idea why you photographed this lol - maybe you''re a creature of impulse who does things because you feel like it. Well done anyway', '2007-09-28 08:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121885, 590294, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the object on the top right that''s moving is - maybe a falling leaf? It would help me more if you''d perhaps had an already fallen leaf in your pic. Still, I like the colours and the autumnal tones.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the object on the top right that''s moving is - maybe a falling leaf? It would help me more if you''d perhaps had an already fallen leaf in your pic. Still, I like the colours and the autumnal tones.', '2007-09-28 08:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121886, 590485, 77192, '<td valign="top">rofl! different. I like it.</td>', 'rofl! different. I like it.', '2007-09-28 08:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121887, 590573, 77192, '<td valign="top">wow, nicely done. Did you use a strobe flash?</td>', 'wow, nicely done. Did you use a strobe flash?', '2007-09-28 08:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121888, 590397, 77192, '<td valign="top">good idea. I''d like it to have been a little sharper however. Also, you appear to have some chromatic aberrations (sp?) on the supports on the easel.</td>', 'good idea. I''d like it to have been a little sharper however. Also, you appear to have some chromatic aberrations (sp?) on the supports on the easel.', '2007-09-28 08:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121889, 590904, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice colours and sharpness.</td>', 'nice colours and sharpness.', '2007-09-28 08:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121891, 590723, 77192, '<td valign="top">wow. I love it. I feel ithers may vote you down a bit because although the hand is obviosly moving, you haven''t illustrated that. But a 9 from me nonetheless</td>', 'wow. I love it. I feel ithers may vote you down a bit because although the hand is obviosly moving, you haven''t illustrated that. But a 9 from me nonetheless', '2007-09-28 08:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121892, 588487, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice idea, I''d have cropped the space on the right though.</td>', 'nice idea, I''d have cropped the space on the right though.', '2007-09-28 08:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121893, 590264, 77192, '<td valign="top">rofl great idea!</td>', 'rofl great idea!', '2007-09-28 08:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4121896, 589970, 77192, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2007-09-28 08:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
