(4122417, 590661, 73452, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and blanket.  but maybe if the whisk was actually whisking something would have been better inmyopinion.</td>', 'i like the lighting and blanket.  but maybe if the whisk was actually whisking something would have been better inmyopinion.', '2007-09-28 13:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
