(4122567, 590862, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good setup (I don''t believe it is real, although it looks believable). If it is real, my apologies, and you must have a great trigger system.</td>', 'Good setup (I don''t believe it is real, although it looks believable). If it is real, my apologies, and you must have a great trigger system.', '2007-09-28 14:41:19.000000', NULL, 1);
