(4123161, 590470, 50695, '<td valign="top">An astonishing photograph. "I hardly can believe it''s real," as the poet says. I simply must give this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'An astonishing photograph. "I hardly can believe it''s real," as the poet says. I simply must give this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2007-09-28 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123162, 590885, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Perfect fulfillment of the challenge, and a bold yet simple, exciting yet elegant composition. A truly modern sensibility, an acknowledgment of classical values and yet a radical negligence of what is expected. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Stunning. Perfect fulfillment of the challenge, and a bold yet simple, exciting yet elegant composition. A truly modern sensibility, an acknowledgment of classical values and yet a radical negligence of what is expected. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you. ', '2007-09-28 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123163, 589937, 50695, '<td valign="top">pure poetry in its purely visual way. Time is a mirror that turns things upside-down instead of backwards. The pendulum points to what you call the past, but the present in the crystal ball is now the past as well, is now a photograph as well. The red tide comes to claim them all.<br/> <br/>and a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'pure poetry in its purely visual way. Time is a mirror that turns things upside-down instead of backwards. The pendulum points to what you call the past, but the present in the crystal ball is now the past as well, is now a photograph as well. The red tide comes to claim them all. and a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you. ', '2007-09-28 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
