(4123375, 590410, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure having that bold border helps. It would if you didn''t have the light streaks in it but since those are there I think it makes the crop feel too tight.</td>', 'I''m not sure having that bold border helps. It would if you didn''t have the light streaks in it but since those are there I think it makes the crop feel too tight.', '2007-09-28 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
