(4123467, 589463, 42840, '<td valign="top">very very nice</td>', 'very very nice', '2007-09-28 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123494, 590764, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well technically there''s life that''s still and something in motion but it''s not in the spirit of the challenge I''m afraid. It''s also not a very engaging photo for me. It depicts a view that most would see just looking down at a dog. There''s no new perspective to be had here. Shoot from a different angle preferrably one that gives energy to that motion, clarifies it, gives focus to it, would be better. Here the motion doesn''t stand out at all. If there is curvature to the tail maintain that so the essense of the tail is still there. As is it looks like the dog has a stump for a tail that is out of focus then anything else.</td>', 'Well technically there''s life that''s still and something in motion but it''s not in the spirit of the challenge I''m afraid. It''s also not a very engaging photo for me. It depicts a view that most would see just looking down at a dog. There''s no new perspective to be had here. Shoot from a different angle preferrably one that gives energy to that motion, clarifies it, gives focus to it, would be better. Here the motion doesn''t stand out at all. If there is curvature to the tail maintain that so the essense of the tail is still there. As is it looks like the dog has a stump for a tail that is out of focus then anything else.', '2007-09-28 22:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123500, 590896, 41337, '<td valign="top">To me a still life is one where the person shooting or painting it controls all the aspects to the image, i.e. it''s composition, lighting, etc. Composition is the only thing I see here that you authored. The lighting and the subject matter appeared to be found and unaltered by you in capturing this shot. The shot does have interest but for me it''s not a good fit for the challenge. Just my opnion though.</td>', 'To me a still life is one where the person shooting or painting it controls all the aspects to the image, i.e. it''s composition, lighting, etc. Composition is the only thing I see here that you authored. The lighting and the subject matter appeared to be found and unaltered by you in capturing this shot. The shot does have interest but for me it''s not a good fit for the challenge. Just my opnion though.', '2007-09-28 23:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123523, 588424, 41337, '<td valign="top">It''s just my take but motion life is different than still life with motion. The smoke is motionless in this photo but so is every other subject ever captured with a camera so I can''t accept that as meeting the still part and since smoke is never still in reality it doesn''t convey stillness either. Just my opinion.</td>', 'It''s just my take but motion life is different than still life with motion. The smoke is motionless in this photo but so is every other subject ever captured with a camera so I can''t accept that as meeting the still part and since smoke is never still in reality it doesn''t convey stillness either. Just my opinion.', '2007-09-28 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123530, 590901, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble finding the still life in this shot. I see lots of stopped motion but that''s it.</td>', 'I''m having trouble finding the still life in this shot. I see lots of stopped motion but that''s it.', '2007-09-28 23:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123538, 589920, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good color and lighting but composition isn''t working for me. The way the background interacts with the foreground is the issue for me. All the parts don''t seem to fit well together within the frame.</td>', 'Good color and lighting but composition isn''t working for me. The way the background interacts with the foreground is the issue for me. All the parts don''t seem to fit well together within the frame.', '2007-09-28 23:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
