(4124210, 589354, 34192, '<td valign="top">the composition is weak and the image feels tilted to the left due to the vertical line in the background.  But, the lighting is excellent as is the timing.  Great being able to capture a curious bird passing through...  Colors also excellent.</td>', 'the composition is weak and the image feels tilted to the left due to the vertical line in the background.  But, the lighting is excellent as is the timing.  Great being able to capture a curious bird passing through...  Colors also excellent.', '2007-09-29 11:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124309, 589774, 37104, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The lighting is a little off, and the colors are bland.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The lighting is a little off, and the colors are bland.', '2007-09-29 12:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124312, 590721, 37104, '<td valign="top">There are so many places to look here. I''m not sure exactly what I''m supposed to be looking at. There are a lot of distracting elements, namely the outside of the window, the cage in the background, the underneath of the chair, the curtains, and the shadows on the wall. You may have elimanted some of those by simply shooting somewhere else.</td>', 'There are so many places to look here. I''m not sure exactly what I''m supposed to be looking at. There are a lot of distracting elements, namely the outside of the window, the cage in the background, the underneath of the chair, the curtains, and the shadows on the wall. You may have elimanted some of those by simply shooting somewhere else.', '2007-09-29 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124314, 590908, 37104, '<td valign="top">there isn''t a strong sense of subject in this shot, and the hand reaching down (or up?) confuses me as to why it is there. The background looks nice, the lighting is pretty good.</td>', 'there isn''t a strong sense of subject in this shot, and the hand reaching down (or up?) confuses me as to why it is there. The background looks nice, the lighting is pretty good.', '2007-09-29 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124316, 589991, 37104, '<td valign="top">The motion is hardly noticeable in this shot. The contrast is great though, and the focus is nice as well. As for a strong center of interest, well it''s not too great.</td>', 'The motion is hardly noticeable in this shot. The contrast is great though, and the focus is nice as well. As for a strong center of interest, well it''s not too great.', '2007-09-29 12:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124318, 589745, 37104, '<td valign="top">The motion takes too much of a back seat in your shot. I''m also left wondering: why are there peppers on rocks by a stream? It just doesn''t make a lot of sense to me. The colors on the peppers look great, although I would have chosen something other than two yellow peppers. The flowers are a nice touch.</td>', 'The motion takes too much of a back seat in your shot. I''m also left wondering: why are there peppers on rocks by a stream? It just doesn''t make a lot of sense to me. The colors on the peppers look great, although I would have chosen something other than two yellow peppers. The flowers are a nice touch.', '2007-09-29 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124320, 590732, 37104, '<td valign="top">There''s a fine line between "in motion" and "blurry," and yours is on the latter end. I love the idea, and the contrast is great. I think the crop is a little too tight on the bottom, but it works alright.</td>', 'There''s a fine line between "in motion" and "blurry," and yours is on the latter end. I love the idea, and the contrast is great. I think the crop is a little too tight on the bottom, but it works alright.', '2007-09-29 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124321, 590789, 37104, '<td valign="top">The soft focus was an interesting idea, but I think it detracts from the idea of discerning "still life" from "motion." Your composition looks a little cluttered, but I love the lighting (minus the dark shadows on the arm). Nice attempt!</td>', 'The soft focus was an interesting idea, but I think it detracts from the idea of discerning "still life" from "motion." Your composition looks a little cluttered, but I love the lighting (minus the dark shadows on the arm). Nice attempt!', '2007-09-29 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124325, 590743, 37104, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I love the empty composition minus the blowing curtain. The lighting is a little dark for my taste, but it''s not terrible. THe biggest problem, is that I don''t see the motion. You may be implying that the window is the still life and the curtain is in motion, but it''s not totally clear, and may get you voted down.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I love the empty composition minus the blowing curtain. The lighting is a little dark for my taste, but it''s not terrible. THe biggest problem, is that I don''t see the motion. You may be implying that the window is the still life and the curtain is in motion, but it''s not totally clear, and may get you voted down.', '2007-09-29 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
