(4124909, 590807, 84784, '<td valign="top">school in a good light</td>', 'school in a good light', '2007-09-29 19:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124941, 590902, 19919, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, the pic, but it does look like the cloning or wrinkle just left of the vase could have used some work.  The lighting can be tough on a shot like this with the white vase and you did well. Good work.</td>', 'I really like the concept, the pic, but it does look like the cloning or wrinkle just left of the vase could have used some work.  The lighting can be tough on a shot like this with the white vase and you did well. Good work.', '2007-09-29 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124983, 589676, 83313, '<td valign="top">The glass bottle appears very sharp while the leaves in it seem different and indistinct to me. I also find the scene outside the window to be drawing my attention away from the real subject. The chattering teeth are an unexpected bit of whimsy in a tabletop still life like this. Nice touch.</td>', 'The glass bottle appears very sharp while the leaves in it seem different and indistinct to me. I also find the scene outside the window to be drawing my attention away from the real subject. The chattering teeth are an unexpected bit of whimsy in a tabletop still life like this. Nice touch.', '2007-09-29 21:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124984, 588424, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like colored smoke? Please put some notes on this so I can know what it is after the challenge is over. Understated, but colorful. I like it.</td>', 'Looks like colored smoke? Please put some notes on this so I can know what it is after the challenge is over. Understated, but colorful. I like it.', '2007-09-29 21:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124990, 590097, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to fill up the frame just a touch too much. Pulling back just a touch and bumping up the colors slightly might help. It''s still a nice shot, though.</td>', 'Seems to fill up the frame just a touch too much. Pulling back just a touch and bumping up the colors slightly might help. It''s still a nice shot, though.', '2007-09-29 21:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124991, 589413, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems like a snapshot to me. Some camera shake is visible as well. I''m afraid I would not call this a still life, either.</td>', 'Seems like a snapshot to me. Some camera shake is visible as well. I''m afraid I would not call this a still life, either.', '2007-09-29 21:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124995, 590805, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and very colorful.</td>', 'Nice concept and very colorful.', '2007-09-29 21:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125002, 590264, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea and good execution. I would have liked a little deeper on the colors, I think it would give it more impact.</td>', 'It''s a good idea and good execution. I would have liked a little deeper on the colors, I think it would give it more impact.', '2007-09-29 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125009, 590776, 83313, '<td valign="top">Definitely a picture with "Impact".</td>', 'Definitely a picture with "Impact".', '2007-09-29 21:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125012, 590870, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see plenty of motion, but where''s the still life?</td>', 'I see plenty of motion, but where''s the still life?', '2007-09-29 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125019, 590862, 83313, '<td valign="top">The direction of motion was not obvious. I had to look some to see where the bullet came from.</td>', 'The direction of motion was not obvious. I had to look some to see where the bullet came from.', '2007-09-29 22:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125024, 590341, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2007-09-29 22:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125078, 590860, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting study. I''m guessing floating.</td>', 'Interesting study. I''m guessing floating.', '2007-09-29 23:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125083, 590748, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is more of a product/ad shot than still life, IMO. Well shot nonetheless.</td>', 'This is more of a product/ad shot than still life, IMO. Well shot nonetheless.', '2007-09-29 23:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125086, 588402, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.', '2007-09-29 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125088, 589886, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. The connection to the challenge is a bit weak, IMO.</td>', 'Fascinating image. The connection to the challenge is a bit weak, IMO.', '2007-09-29 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125091, 590900, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the strong contrast and color. Interesting image.</td>', 'I like the strong contrast and color. Interesting image.', '2007-09-29 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125100, 590558, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot. Good contrast. However, the composition is buggy me a little. The reflection is so strong in this image that I wonder if it shouldn''t have a bigger row in the composition.</td>', 'Not a bad shot. Good contrast. However, the composition is buggy me a little. The reflection is so strong in this image that I wonder if it shouldn''t have a bigger row in the composition.', '2007-09-29 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125111, 590047, 41337, '<td valign="top">This makes for an interesting long exposure/street scene image. Not sure I can say this is still life though. Now had you arranged the cars to your liking, set the lighting and cued the motion on your command then it would be like a still life and probably would make for a more fascinating piece of art too. I just think a still life demands that you take part in it''s creation and not merely document what is already there. Just my opinion.</td>', 'This makes for an interesting long exposure/street scene image. Not sure I can say this is still life though. Now had you arranged the cars to your liking, set the lighting and cued the motion on your command then it would be like a still life and probably would make for a more fascinating piece of art too. I just think a still life demands that you take part in it''s creation and not merely document what is already there. Just my opinion.', '2007-09-29 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125157, 590113, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a clever idea but for me it doesn''t meet the still life aspect. In my opinion, still life is suppose to be a break from documentation (i.e. think setup) and this on the other hand documents the effects of the earth''s rotation as captured with a camera.</td>', 'Nice shot with a clever idea but for me it doesn''t meet the still life aspect. In my opinion, still life is suppose to be a break from documentation (i.e. think setup) and this on the other hand documents the effects of the earth''s rotation as captured with a camera.', '2007-09-29 23:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125160, 590471, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t see the relevancy to the challenge topic at all.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t see the relevancy to the challenge topic at all.', '2007-09-29 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125165, 590264, 41337, '<td valign="top">Perhaps on the silly side but at least it seems to meet the challenge theme, which so many others failed to do. Good luck.</td>', 'Perhaps on the silly side but at least it seems to meet the challenge theme, which so many others failed to do. Good luck.', '2007-09-29 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125174, 589745, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I see the motion part but for me it seems to only exist to meet the challenge. I wish it played a bigger, more meaningful role, in the shot. Other than that not a bad shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Good composition. I see the motion part but for me it seems to only exist to meet the challenge. I wish it played a bigger, more meaningful role, in the shot. Other than that not a bad shot. Good luck.', '2007-09-29 23:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125189, 590870, 41337, '<td valign="top">A heck of a capture but for me you''ve only met the motion aspect of this challenge.<br/> <br/>Returning to bump this up. It has grown on me since first viewing it. One thing that this has that others don''t is a sense of creation. This doesn''t exist if you don''t make it happen so in that respect it''s much like still life. Also, I can''t help but appreciate the reversal of still vs motion you did in this shot. The ball should be in motion but it''s not and the players who should be more stationary than the ball is in motion thanks to the motion blur. Clever photo.</td>', 'A heck of a capture but for me you''ve only met the motion aspect of this challenge. Returning to bump this up. It has grown on me since first viewing it. One thing that this has that others don''t is a sense of creation. This doesn''t exist if you don''t make it happen so in that respect it''s much like still life. Also, I can''t help but appreciate the reversal of still vs motion you did in this shot. The ball should be in motion but it''s not and the players who should be more stationary than the ball is in motion thanks to the motion blur. Clever photo.', '2007-09-30 00:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125206, 589413, 41337, '<td valign="top">One thing that makes still life what it is, is the break from the candid/documentary technique. While some of the cars are still they don''t make for a convincing still life because this is just documenting what you saw. In other words, you didn''t set this shot up.</td>', 'One thing that makes still life what it is, is the break from the candid/documentary technique. While some of the cars are still they don''t make for a convincing still life because this is just documenting what you saw. In other words, you didn''t set this shot up.', '2007-09-30 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125425, 590721, 16106, '<td valign="top">there is a chaos captured here, im not sure what you wanted me to focus on; the birdcage, the violin, the reflection in the window all vie for attention.</td>', 'there is a chaos captured here, im not sure what you wanted me to focus on; the birdcage, the violin, the reflection in the window all vie for attention.', '2007-09-30 02:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
