(4125773, 590732, 70000, '<td valign="top">this seems a bit busy to me. I think to improve composition i would have taken out the milk bottle and oreo package and left just the cup and the oreos so that the focus was on those things and the moving hand would stand out better. cute idea!</td>', 'this seems a bit busy to me. I think to improve composition i would have taken out the milk bottle and oreo package and left just the cup and the oreos so that the focus was on those things and the moving hand would stand out better. cute idea!', '2007-09-30 11:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125774, 589991, 70000, '<td valign="top">the background is a bit destracting, i think if you had just zoomed in on the watch the focus would be directed better. Nice use of the watch for motion</td>', 'the background is a bit destracting, i think if you had just zoomed in on the watch the focus would be directed better. Nice use of the watch for motion', '2007-09-30 11:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125780, 589937, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the element of the reflecting ball but this whole composition seems just too busy. the lighting is also kind of flat, I would have juse left in the ball red cloth and pendulum, the picture and the beads don''t add in my opinion</td>', 'I love the element of the reflecting ball but this whole composition seems just too busy. the lighting is also kind of flat, I would have juse left in the ball red cloth and pendulum, the picture and the beads don''t add in my opinion', '2007-09-30 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125781, 590805, 70000, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting and awesome colors! great use of the challenge description</td>', 'beautiful lighting and awesome colors! great use of the challenge description', '2007-09-30 11:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125783, 590341, 70000, '<td valign="top">WOAH...I am completely stumped as to how this was done....wow...this is so cool! Without the moving guy I don;t think I would call this a still life necessarily though. I can''t wait to know how you did this</td>', 'WOAH...I am completely stumped as to how this was done....wow...this is so cool! Without the moving guy I don;t think I would call this a still life necessarily though. I can''t wait to know how you did this', '2007-09-30 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125785, 590723, 70000, '<td valign="top">your lighting is awesome! beautiful choice of hand as well. The stawberries are really well composed</td>', 'your lighting is awesome! beautiful choice of hand as well. The stawberries are really well composed', '2007-09-30 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125790, 589884, 70000, '<td valign="top">did you take this cup to a river? very very clever. beautiful well lit photo great job</td>', 'did you take this cup to a river? very very clever. beautiful well lit photo great job', '2007-09-30 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125791, 590743, 70000, '<td valign="top">STUNNING! I actually gasped when I saw this. This one has the issue of "is it a still life" blh blah blah to it but This is an excellent photo with great use of the motion element.</td>', 'STUNNING! I actually gasped when I saw this. This one has the issue of "is it a still life" blh blah blah to it but This is an excellent photo with great use of the motion element.', '2007-09-30 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125794, 589378, 70000, '<td valign="top">excellent still life composition, i am still trying to decide whether I like the contrast with the pinwheel. Everything else in the photo is muted and natural while the pinwheel is shiny and plastic, cool photo but i will have to come back to it</td>', 'excellent still life composition, i am still trying to decide whether I like the contrast with the pinwheel. Everything else in the photo is muted and natural while the pinwheel is shiny and plastic, cool photo but i will have to come back to it', '2007-09-30 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
