(4125796, 590748, 70000, '<td valign="top">this is the second shot in a river i have seen and I think I like tis one more. I love that yall thought of that though moving water is so elegant and beautiful. very nice!</td>', 'this is the second shot in a river i have seen and I think I like tis one more. I love that yall thought of that though moving water is so elegant and beautiful. very nice!', '2007-09-30 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
