(4125807, 590767, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice! for me the neon blue doesn''t really go with the subtle greens of the rest of the photo though. still lovely shot and neat concept</td>', 'nice! for me the neon blue doesn''t really go with the subtle greens of the rest of the photo though. still lovely shot and neat concept', '2007-09-30 11:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
