(4125810, 590492, 70000, '<td valign="top">hahaha thank you thank you thank you! i have seen so many versions of this same picture over and over again and for me you just took it and WHAM! made it different. AWESOME!</td>', 'hahaha thank you thank you thank you! i have seen so many versions of this same picture over and over again and for me you just took it and WHAM! made it different. AWESOME!', '2007-09-30 11:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
