(4126610, 589071, 41337, '<td valign="top">The colors are good. I particularly like how the cool blues interact with the greens and browns. I''m not crazy about the POV and the lighting though. Both are very bland and do nothing to give this shot personality. Given your title a glowy/volumetric type of lighting, the kind you see early morning would have worked better. Just a thought.</td>', 'The colors are good. I particularly like how the cool blues interact with the greens and browns. I''m not crazy about the POV and the lighting though. Both are very bland and do nothing to give this shot personality. Given your title a glowy/volumetric type of lighting, the kind you see early morning would have worked better. Just a thought.', '2007-09-30 22:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
