(4127295, 589676, 60862, '<td valign="top">To me, this was the epitome of the challenge:  you have a lovely still life all on its own, and then you added some motion.  In my case, you definitely scored a laugh. :)</td>', 'To me, this was the epitome of the challenge:  you have a lovely still life all on its own, and then you added some motion.  In my case, you definitely scored a laugh. :)', '2007-10-01 02:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4127300, 590900, 60862, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 8s.  I thought the composition was beautiful and the tones interesting.  In fact, and I mean this as a high compliment, I was sure this was from one of my fellow Team Suckers.  I''ll be nominating this for an OOBie award for wonderful out-of-the-box shots.</td>', 'I was one of your 8s.  I thought the composition was beautiful and the tones interesting.  In fact, and I mean this as a high compliment, I was sure this was from one of my fellow Team Suckers.  I''ll be nominating this for an OOBie award for wonderful out-of-the-box shots.', '2007-10-01 02:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
