(4127466, 590341, 68035, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Charlene!!!!!<br/> <br/>A new PB but more importantly a fantastic image and a great reminder of a fun shoot.  I am so glad I prodded you because it means that a lot more people get to see this wonderful shot.  Top job!!!!!</td>', 'Congratulations Charlene!!!!! A new PB but more importantly a fantastic image and a great reminder of a fun shoot.  I am so glad I prodded you because it means that a lot more people get to see this wonderful shot.  Top job!!!!!', '2007-10-01 04:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4127469, 590885, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Lisa.  I dont know why but in a way it made me think of a prison cell (not that I would know what a prison cell looked like obviously) with the flower and vase representing the fact that things of beauty can be found everywhere<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'Cool shot Lisa.  I dont know why but in a way it made me think of a prison cell (not that I would know what a prison cell looked like obviously) with the flower and vase representing the fact that things of beauty can be found everywhere Good job', '2007-10-01 04:44:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4127470, 589354, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well done on the top 10 finish.  ANother stunning shot and I am grateful that you explained exactly how you had managed to set this up<br/> <br/>Your neighbour may think you are nuts but I think you are a fantastically creative photographer whose execution matches their imagination<br/> <br/>Great image</td>', 'Well done on the top 10 finish.  ANother stunning shot and I am grateful that you explained exactly how you had managed to set this up Your neighbour may think you are nuts but I think you are a fantastically creative photographer whose execution matches their imagination Great image', '2007-10-01 04:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4127472, 590896, 68035, '<td valign="top">Boo!  I gave this a much higher score than the average.  It met the challenge really well and I loved the differing motion of the water, from the circular ripples near the bank to the impressionism style reflection farther out</td>', 'Boo!  I gave this a much higher score than the average.  It met the challenge really well and I loved the differing motion of the water, from the circular ripples near the bank to the impressionism style reflection farther out', '2007-10-01 04:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4127473, 590277, 68035, '<td valign="top">When I saw this picture of a gyroscope I slapped my head as I thought it represented the perfect depiction of stillness and motion in a single subject.  Love the over exposed background.  Definitely has a real print feel about it.  Great shot and a great finish</td>', 'When I saw this picture of a gyroscope I slapped my head as I thought it represented the perfect depiction of stillness and motion in a single subject.  Love the over exposed background.  Definitely has a real print feel about it.  Great shot and a great finish', '2007-10-01 04:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
