(4128315, 588154, 82088, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I really liked your take on the challenge, and would have given it an 8.  Very creative!  I also think it would have been cool to somehow have the wine in the glass splashing a little, so you know, as the picture is being carried away, the wine is splashing from being moved.  Just an idea! :)<br/> <br/>P.S.-For future reference, lemon juice works really well to keep your apples from browning once they''ve been cut.  Or if you plan to eat them afterwords, than 7-Up work too, and tastes better than lemon juice.  Unless of course you were going for that look, in which case just ignore me! =)</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I really liked your take on the challenge, and would have given it an 8.  Very creative!  I also think it would have been cool to somehow have the wine in the glass splashing a little, so you know, as the picture is being carried away, the wine is splashing from being moved.  Just an idea! :) P.S.-For future reference, lemon juice works really well to keep your apples from browning once they''ve been cut.  Or if you plan to eat them afterwords, than 7-Up work too, and tastes better than lemon juice.  Unless of course you were going for that look, in which case just ignore me! =)', '2007-10-01 10:18:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4128331, 590277, 64987, '<td valign="top">This was my highest score for the challenge. I am surprised it didn''t do better.</td>', 'This was my highest score for the challenge. I am surprised it didn''t do better.', '2007-10-01 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4128343, 590742, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon, great shot. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon, great shot. :)', '2007-10-01 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4128359, 590807, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, effort and perserverance will eventually yield great results. It''s a great academically themed shot. Try selling it.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, even the pencil is pointing toward the spinning globe.<br/>Cropping, using a partial globe, also puts more emphasis on the globe.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-29 12:08:19.</i></td>', 'Congratulations, effort and perserverance will eventually yield great results. It''s a great academically themed shot. Try selling it. Compositionally, even the pencil is pointing toward the spinning globe.Cropping, using a partial globe, also puts more emphasis on the globe.', '2007-10-01 10:30:37.000000', '2007-10-29 12:08:19.000000', 0),
