(4131160, 589354, 64176, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2007-10-01 22:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131162, 589937, 61651, '<td valign="top">If I watch that swinging pendulum long enough, the present scene reflected in the crystal ball may alter to show the future, and all the while I have tokens of the past within view to ground me - it''s like some ritual for evoking second sight.  Nice tight composition.</td>', 'If I watch that swinging pendulum long enough, the present scene reflected in the crystal ball may alter to show the future, and all the while I have tokens of the past within view to ground me - it''s like some ritual for evoking second sight.  Nice tight composition.', '2007-10-01 22:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131169, 590873, 64176, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2007-10-01 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131174, 590805, 64176, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2007-10-01 22:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131186, 590910, 61651, '<td valign="top">Now here I was thinking you had somehow managed the shot upside down!  Great idea for the cork explosion, I wonder if using something a bit foamy would have provided more contrast - but still a great idea for adding a kick of motion to the traditional still life.</td>', 'Now here I was thinking you had somehow managed the shot upside down!  Great idea for the cork explosion, I wonder if using something a bit foamy would have provided more contrast - but still a great idea for adding a kick of motion to the traditional still life.', '2007-10-01 22:23:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131188, 590826, 64176, '<td valign="top">Love this!  And I loved Colorcarnival''s voice over down there... great! I''m a tea-aholic too.  I would so buy a print of this!  Will you make available?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-01 21:24:49.</i></td>', 'Love this!  And I loved Colorcarnival''s voice over down there... great! I''m a tea-aholic too.  I would so buy a print of this!  Will you make available?', '2007-10-01 22:24:10.000000', '2007-10-01 22:24:49.000000', 0),
(4131200, 589764, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great blocks of color in this setup - I would have done it the hard way - actually cut the flowers during the exposure, would not have thought of arranging the pieces on wire to look as if they were flung there by the cutting gestures.  You accomplished not just a sense of motion, but of real spite-driven *action* - I can see her in my mind''s eye, snip, snip, SNIP!</td>', 'Great blocks of color in this setup - I would have done it the hard way - actually cut the flowers during the exposure, would not have thought of arranging the pieces on wire to look as if they were flung there by the cutting gestures.  You accomplished not just a sense of motion, but of real spite-driven *action* - I can see her in my mind''s eye, snip, snip, SNIP!', '2007-10-01 22:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131295, 589937, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like the rich colors and the light in this.</td>', 'I really like the rich colors and the light in this.', '2007-10-01 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131343, 590721, 61651, '<td valign="top">Soothed to the point of being rendered ceramic!  Now *that''s* a still life.  :)  This is appealingly surreal.</td>', 'Soothed to the point of being rendered ceramic!  Now *that''s* a still life.  :)  This is appealingly surreal.', '2007-10-01 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131366, 590886, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, although the backdrop is perhaps a little too vibrant and competes with the foreground arrangement.  The flowers lead you invitingly up to that brilliant blue ball.  Will this go out into your garden or is it an indoor feature?</td>', 'Beautiful colors, although the backdrop is perhaps a little too vibrant and competes with the foreground arrangement.  The flowers lead you invitingly up to that brilliant blue ball.  Will this go out into your garden or is it an indoor feature?', '2007-10-01 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131397, 590896, 61651, '<td valign="top">What exhibits more lively stillness than rippled water?  I like how you extended the countering notions of stillness/motion here.  LOL, I just noticed that *little* bug seemingly walking the gangplank out to the edge!</td>', 'What exhibits more lively stillness than rippled water?  I like how you extended the countering notions of stillness/motion here.  LOL, I just noticed that *little* bug seemingly walking the gangplank out to the edge!', '2007-10-01 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131410, 590902, 61651, '<td valign="top">The clock/passage of time idea is a good one, especially to give it further meaning by suggesting death in your still life.  The backdrop is a bit noisy/sharply defined - given that your foreground subjects are fairly close to one another and almost parallel, you could use a wider aperture and still keep your subjects in focus while making the background more blurred and less noticeable.</td>', 'The clock/passage of time idea is a good one, especially to give it further meaning by suggesting death in your still life.  The backdrop is a bit noisy/sharply defined - given that your foreground subjects are fairly close to one another and almost parallel, you could use a wider aperture and still keep your subjects in focus while making the background more blurred and less noticeable.', '2007-10-01 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131423, 589920, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice splash of color with that flower to complement the splash of water!  I think the image might be strengthened if the top bit was cropped out, so the flower forms much of the top border and the waterfall begins at the corner with no discernible source.</td>', 'Nice splash of color with that flower to complement the splash of water!  I think the image might be strengthened if the top bit was cropped out, so the flower forms much of the top border and the waterfall begins at the corner with no discernible source.', '2007-10-01 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
