(4143168, 589378, 30982, '<td valign="top">You don''t know how to score low well.  :-)  To be honest, this doesn''t do much for me - a decent enough still life but a bit lacking in depth, warmth.  No real reason at all for the pinwheel except to meet the challenge (and a good way to do that) - strikes me as weird in this setting.  Had the still life been more of a 4th of July All American picnic kinda thing, then the pinwheel would have seemed appropriate.  <br/> <br/>But it scored a 6.5 and came in in the top ten, so what do I know!  :-)</td>', 'You don''t know how to score low well.  :-)  To be honest, this doesn''t do much for me - a decent enough still life but a bit lacking in depth, warmth.  No real reason at all for the pinwheel except to meet the challenge (and a good way to do that) - strikes me as weird in this setting.  Had the still life been more of a 4th of July All American picnic kinda thing, then the pinwheel would have seemed appropriate.   But it scored a 6.5 and came in in the top ten, so what do I know!  :-)', '2007-10-05 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
